{"id":"en_cheap-food-high-price","title":"Cheap Food, High Price","titleEn":"Cheap Food, High Price","description":"Wei Ying, a CEO, has been quietly preparing meals for her company's employees without revealing who she is. Her secret comes to light in a painful way when she walks in on her husband Zou Rui with his mistress Ai Li. Ai Li then spreads false claims about Wei Ying's cooking and seizes control of the business, replacing the food with inexpensive pre-made meals. The workers eventually suffer food poisoning, and in the aftermath, they learn that the woman who had been cooking for them all along was in fact their company's CEO. Those interested in following the series can find it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/cheap-food-high-price/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/cheap-food-high-price/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identity Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlrk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_cheap-food-high-price_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlrk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_cheap-food-high-price_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlrk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_cheap-food-high-price_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlrk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_cheap-food-high-price_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble